{"id":3768,"date":"2018-02-25T16:05:12","date_gmt":"2018-02-25T15:05:12","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/?p=3768"},"modified":"2018-02-25T16:16:20","modified_gmt":"2018-02-25T15:16:20","slug":"git-et-github-experiences-et-resultats","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/2018\/02\/25\/git-et-github-experiences-et-resultats\/","title":{"rendered":"GIt et GitHub &#8211; exp\u00e9riences et r\u00e9sultats"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>Suite \u00e0 la conf\u00e9rence de Nicolas, voici quelques exp\u00e9riences avec Git et plus particuli\u00e8rement GitHub.<\/p>\n<p>On va respectivement:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Mettre un r\u00e9pertoire existant dans Git;<\/li>\n<li>Utiliser l&rsquo;application <strong>Desktop<\/strong>;<\/li>\n<li>Travailler avec 2 PCs sur un r\u00e9pertoire partag\u00e9;<\/li>\n<li>Synchroniser deux PCs avec <strong>git-gui,<\/strong> et modifier et re-synchroniser les r\u00e9pertoires<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h1><strong>R\u00e9pertoire existant -&gt;GIT<\/strong><\/h1>\n<p>Le but est de d\u00e9poser un code existant de son PC sur GitHub, de mani\u00e8re \u00e0 pouvoir le maintenir. Et surtout de d\u00e9jouer quelques pi\u00e8ges, car devant la complexit\u00e9 de GitHub, on titube (d\u00e9sol\u00e9, je n&rsquo;ai pas pu me retenir).<\/p>\n<p>Exemple: le contenu du r\u00e9pertoire \u00ab\u00a0main_lpc\u00a0\u00bb (c&rsquo;est du code Arduino). Aller dans le r\u00e9pertoire\u00a0:<\/p>\n<p>C:\\Programs\\Git&gt;<strong>cd c:\\Users\\Masur\\OneDrive\\Documents\\Arduino\\Soft\\main_lpc<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Initialiser:<br \/>\nc:\\Users\\Masur\\OneDrive\\Documents\\Arduino\\Soft\\main_lpc&gt;<strong>git init<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Initialized empty Git repository in c:\/Users\/Masur\/OneDrive\/Documents\/Arduino\/Soft\/main_lpc\/.git\/<\/p>\n<p>Ici, attention \u00e0 r\u00e9sister \u00e0 la tentation \u00e0 donner le nom de r\u00e9pertoire \u00ab\u00a0lpc_main\u00a0\u00bb, qui serait cr\u00e9\u00e9. Pousser tous les fichiers:<\/p>\n<p>c:\\Users\\Masur\\OneDrive\\Documents\\Arduino\\Soft\\main_lpc&gt;<strong>git add .<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>warning: LF will be replaced by CRLF in const_def.h.<br \/>\nThe file will have its original line endings in your working directory.<\/p>\n<p>Cet avertissement vaut pour tous les fichiers *.ino, *.h ou texte<br \/>\nPousser les fichiers dans le r\u00e9pertoire Git local:<\/p>\n<p>c:\\Users\\Masur\\OneDrive\\Documents\\Arduino\\Soft\\main_lpc&gt;<strong>git commit -m \u00ab\u00a0version du 26.07.2015\u00a0\u00bb<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>[master (root-commit) f1a0ba2] version du 26.07.2015<br \/>\n9 files changed, 806 insertions(+)<br \/>\ncreate mode 100644 const_def.h\u00a0 &#8230; ect pour les 9 fichiers.<\/p>\n<p>Ensuite, toutes les commandes <strong>git remote<\/strong> \u00e9chouent.\u00a0Via le WEB, cr\u00e9ation du d\u00e9p\u00f4t distant\u00a0(GitHub):<\/p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1374\" height=\"1023\" class=\"wp-image-3769\" src=\"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/02\/http-microclub-ch-wp-content-uploads-2017-11-wor.png\" alt=\"http:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/word-image-13.png\" srcset=\"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/02\/http-microclub-ch-wp-content-uploads-2017-11-wor.png 1374w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/02\/http-microclub-ch-wp-content-uploads-2017-11-wor-300x223.png 300w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/02\/http-microclub-ch-wp-content-uploads-2017-11-wor-768x572.png 768w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/02\/http-microclub-ch-wp-content-uploads-2017-11-wor-1024x762.png 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1374px) 100vw, 1374px\" \/><\/p>\n<p>Essai avec l&rsquo;appli <strong>Desktop<\/strong>, pour pousser les fichiers sur GitHub. Choix du r\u00e9pertoire, renseign\u00e9 dans les deux champs: repository et local :<\/p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1443\" height=\"994\" class=\"wp-image-3770\" src=\"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/02\/http-microclub-ch-wp-content-uploads-2017-11-wor-1.png\" alt=\"http:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/word-image-14.png\" srcset=\"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/02\/http-microclub-ch-wp-content-uploads-2017-11-wor-1.png 1443w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/02\/http-microclub-ch-wp-content-uploads-2017-11-wor-1-300x207.png 300w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/02\/http-microclub-ch-wp-content-uploads-2017-11-wor-1-768x529.png 768w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/02\/http-microclub-ch-wp-content-uploads-2017-11-wor-1-1024x705.png 1024w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/02\/http-microclub-ch-wp-content-uploads-2017-11-wor-1-130x90.png 130w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1443px) 100vw, 1443px\" \/><\/p>\n<p>Mauvaise id\u00e9e&#8230; un sous r\u00e9pertoire du m\u00eame nom est cr\u00e9\u00e9!<\/p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1106\" height=\"477\" class=\"wp-image-3771\" src=\"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/02\/http-microclub-ch-wp-content-uploads-2017-11-wor-2.png\" alt=\"http:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/word-image-15.png\" srcset=\"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/02\/http-microclub-ch-wp-content-uploads-2017-11-wor-2.png 1106w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/02\/http-microclub-ch-wp-content-uploads-2017-11-wor-2-300x129.png 300w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/02\/http-microclub-ch-wp-content-uploads-2017-11-wor-2-768x331.png 768w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/02\/http-microclub-ch-wp-content-uploads-2017-11-wor-2-1024x442.png 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1106px) 100vw, 1106px\" \/><\/p>\n<p>Delete du r\u00e9pertoire \u2026\/main_lpc\/<strong>main_lpc<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>S\u00e9lection avec Desktop, puis Publish (but, pousser les fichiers sur GIT-HUB)<\/p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1445\" height=\"996\" class=\"wp-image-3772\" src=\"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/02\/http-microclub-ch-wp-content-uploads-2017-11-wor-3.png\" alt=\"http:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/word-image-16.png\" srcset=\"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/02\/http-microclub-ch-wp-content-uploads-2017-11-wor-3.png 1445w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/02\/http-microclub-ch-wp-content-uploads-2017-11-wor-3-300x207.png 300w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/02\/http-microclub-ch-wp-content-uploads-2017-11-wor-3-768x529.png 768w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/02\/http-microclub-ch-wp-content-uploads-2017-11-wor-3-1024x706.png 1024w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/02\/http-microclub-ch-wp-content-uploads-2017-11-wor-3-130x90.png 130w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1445px) 100vw, 1445px\" \/><\/p>\n<p>Le d\u00e9p\u00f4t pr\u00e9c\u00e9demment cr\u00e9\u00e9 par le WEB g\u00eane.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Solution<\/strong>\u00a0: delete du d\u00e9p\u00f4t sur GitHub, puis recommencer l\u2019op\u00e9ration \u00ab\u00a0Publish\u00a0\u00bb, qui r\u00e9ussit.<\/p>\n<h1><strong>Pi\u00e8ge du r\u00e9pertoire partag\u00e9<\/strong><\/h1>\n<p>Vous avez peut-\u00eatre remarqu\u00e9 que j&rsquo;utilise OneDrive pour stocker mes fichiers. Ceci me pr\u00e9muni contre une panne de HDD et me permet de partager le code sur plusieurs PC. Par contre, si les r\u00e9pertoires ne sont pas strictement identiques entre les 2 PCs, impossible d&rsquo;utiliser Git sur le second! On obtient:<\/p>\n<p>~\\Documents\\Arduino\\Soft\\Blink\\blink2 [master \u2261 +0 ~0 -1 ~]&gt; git push<br \/>\nTo https:\/\/github.com\/ymasur\/blink2<br \/>\n! [rejected] master -&gt; master (fetch first)<br \/>\nerror: failed to push some refs to &lsquo;https:\/\/github.com\/ymasur\/blink2&rsquo;<br \/>\nhint: Updates were rejected because the remote contains work that you do<br \/>\nhint: not have locally. This is usually caused by another repository pushing<br \/>\nhint: to the same ref. You may want to first integrate the remote changes<\/p>\n<p>Dommage&#8230;<\/p>\n<h2><strong>Synchro de GitHub, de PC1 et de PC2<\/strong><\/h2>\n<p>Situation: on d\u00e9veloppe sur le\u00a0 PC1, mais on aimerait poursuivre sur PC2, comme si 2 utilisateurs travaillent \u00e0 tour de r\u00f4le. Ici, on utilise Git-Gui.exe, que l&rsquo;on peut lancer depuis la ligne de commande par: git-gui.<\/p>\n<p>Le code &#8211; en l&rsquo;occurrence blink2 Arduino &#8211; est d\u00e9j\u00e0 d\u00e9pos\u00e9 sur GitHub.<\/p>\n<h2><strong>Git-gui (sur PC2)<\/strong><\/h2>\n<p>Etape 1: Clone. Le r\u00e9pertoire local ne doit <strong>pas pr\u00e9exister<\/strong>. Charger localement depuis GitHub\u00a0:<\/p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"776\" height=\"330\" class=\"wp-image-3773\" src=\"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/02\/http-microclub-ch-wp-content-uploads-2017-11-wor-4.png\" alt=\"http:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/word-image-17.png\" srcset=\"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/02\/http-microclub-ch-wp-content-uploads-2017-11-wor-4.png 776w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/02\/http-microclub-ch-wp-content-uploads-2017-11-wor-4-300x128.png 300w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/02\/http-microclub-ch-wp-content-uploads-2017-11-wor-4-768x327.png 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 776px) 100vw, 776px\" \/><\/p>\n<h2><strong>Ajout et modification de fichier<\/strong><\/h2>\n<p>Le fichier toto.txt (compl\u00e8tement bidon) est ajout\u00e9. Rescan\u00a0:<\/p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1344\" height=\"779\" class=\"wp-image-3774\" src=\"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/02\/http-microclub-ch-wp-content-uploads-2017-11-wor-5.png\" alt=\"http:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/word-image-18.png\" srcset=\"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/02\/http-microclub-ch-wp-content-uploads-2017-11-wor-5.png 1344w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/02\/http-microclub-ch-wp-content-uploads-2017-11-wor-5-300x174.png 300w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/02\/http-microclub-ch-wp-content-uploads-2017-11-wor-5-768x445.png 768w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/02\/http-microclub-ch-wp-content-uploads-2017-11-wor-5-1024x594.png 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1344px) 100vw, 1344px\" \/><\/p>\n<p>Pour la bonne forme, je modifie le commentaire de blink2.ino. Une fois les modifs termin\u00e9es, cliquer le fichier pour le passer \u00e0 Staged\u2026<\/p>\n<p>Puis [Commit] pour enregistrer <em>localement<\/em> la(les) diff\u00e9rence(s)<\/p>\n<h2><strong>Nouvelle version sur GitHub<\/strong><\/h2>\n<p>La modif est seulement locale. On la met sur GitHub avec [Push] :<\/p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"818\" height=\"846\" class=\"wp-image-3775\" src=\"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/02\/http-microclub-ch-wp-content-uploads-2017-11-wor-6.png\" alt=\"http:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/word-image-19.png\" srcset=\"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/02\/http-microclub-ch-wp-content-uploads-2017-11-wor-6.png 818w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/02\/http-microclub-ch-wp-content-uploads-2017-11-wor-6-290x300.png 290w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/02\/http-microclub-ch-wp-content-uploads-2017-11-wor-6-768x794.png 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 818px) 100vw, 818px\" \/><\/p>\n<p>V\u00e9rification sur GitHub, via le WEB :<\/p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1299\" height=\"894\" class=\"wp-image-3776\" src=\"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/02\/http-microclub-ch-wp-content-uploads-2017-11-wor-7.png\" alt=\"http:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/word-image-20.png\" srcset=\"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/02\/http-microclub-ch-wp-content-uploads-2017-11-wor-7.png 1299w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/02\/http-microclub-ch-wp-content-uploads-2017-11-wor-7-300x206.png 300w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/02\/http-microclub-ch-wp-content-uploads-2017-11-wor-7-768x529.png 768w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/02\/http-microclub-ch-wp-content-uploads-2017-11-wor-7-1024x705.png 1024w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/02\/http-microclub-ch-wp-content-uploads-2017-11-wor-7-130x90.png 130w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1299px) 100vw, 1299px\" \/><\/p>\n<p>Le fichier toto.txt est bien ajout\u00e9; et blink2.ino touch\u00e9.<\/p>\n<h1><strong>Modif avec un r\u00e9pertoire clon\u00e9 sur PC1<\/strong><\/h1>\n<h2><strong>Contr\u00f4le des changements<\/strong><\/h2>\n<p>Repository -&gt; Visualize master\u2019s history<\/p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1048\" height=\"894\" class=\"wp-image-3777\" src=\"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/02\/http-microclub-ch-wp-content-uploads-2017-11-wor-8.png\" alt=\"http:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/word-image-21.png\" srcset=\"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/02\/http-microclub-ch-wp-content-uploads-2017-11-wor-8.png 1048w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/02\/http-microclub-ch-wp-content-uploads-2017-11-wor-8-300x256.png 300w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/02\/http-microclub-ch-wp-content-uploads-2017-11-wor-8-768x655.png 768w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/02\/http-microclub-ch-wp-content-uploads-2017-11-wor-8-1024x874.png 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1048px) 100vw, 1048px\" \/><\/p>\n<h2><strong>Modifications par PC1<\/strong><\/h2>\n<p>Delete de toto.txt\u00a0; modif de blink2.ino (on remodifie le commentaire)<\/p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1127\" height=\"635\" class=\"wp-image-3778\" src=\"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/02\/http-microclub-ch-wp-content-uploads-2017-11-wor-9.png\" alt=\"http:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/word-image-22.png\" srcset=\"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/02\/http-microclub-ch-wp-content-uploads-2017-11-wor-9.png 1127w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/02\/http-microclub-ch-wp-content-uploads-2017-11-wor-9-300x169.png 300w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/02\/http-microclub-ch-wp-content-uploads-2017-11-wor-9-768x433.png 768w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/02\/http-microclub-ch-wp-content-uploads-2017-11-wor-9-1024x577.png 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1127px) 100vw, 1127px\" \/><\/p>\n<p>Commit et push de cette version\u00a0:<\/p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"853\" height=\"371\" class=\"wp-image-3779\" src=\"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/02\/http-microclub-ch-wp-content-uploads-2017-11-wor-10.png\" alt=\"http:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/word-image-23.png\" srcset=\"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/02\/http-microclub-ch-wp-content-uploads-2017-11-wor-10.png 853w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/02\/http-microclub-ch-wp-content-uploads-2017-11-wor-10-300x130.png 300w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/02\/http-microclub-ch-wp-content-uploads-2017-11-wor-10-768x334.png 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 853px) 100vw, 853px\" \/><\/p>\n<h2><strong>Synchro sur PC2<\/strong><\/h2>\n<p><strong>Obtenir une r\u00e9plication correcte (sans tout cloner)<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Pour m\u00e9moire, on a supprim\u00e9 le fichier toto.txt. Etape 1, synchro du d\u00e9p\u00f4t local de PC2: <strong>git fetch<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1022\" height=\"415\" class=\"wp-image-3780\" src=\"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/02\/http-microclub-ch-wp-content-uploads-2017-11-wor-11.png\" alt=\"http:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/word-image-24.png\" srcset=\"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/02\/http-microclub-ch-wp-content-uploads-2017-11-wor-11.png 1022w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/02\/http-microclub-ch-wp-content-uploads-2017-11-wor-11-300x122.png 300w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/02\/http-microclub-ch-wp-content-uploads-2017-11-wor-11-768x312.png 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1022px) 100vw, 1022px\" \/><\/p>\n<p>Etape 2: synchro r\u00e9pertoire de travail\u00a0: <strong>git merge<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1022\" height=\"415\" class=\"wp-image-3781\" src=\"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/02\/http-microclub-ch-wp-content-uploads-2017-11-wor-12.png\" alt=\"http:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/word-image-25.png\" srcset=\"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/02\/http-microclub-ch-wp-content-uploads-2017-11-wor-12.png 1022w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/02\/http-microclub-ch-wp-content-uploads-2017-11-wor-12-300x122.png 300w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/02\/http-microclub-ch-wp-content-uploads-2017-11-wor-12-768x312.png 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1022px) 100vw, 1022px\" \/><\/p>\n<p>Le r\u00e9pertoire local est \u00e0 jour sur le PC2.<\/p>\n<p>Yves Masur (11\/2017)<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Suite \u00e0 la conf\u00e9rence de Nicolas, voici quelques exp\u00e9riences avec Git et plus particuli\u00e8rement GitHub. On va respectivement: Mettre un<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":37,"featured_media":3774,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"colormag_page_container_layout":"default_layout","colormag_page_sidebar_layout":"default_layout","footnotes":""},"categories":[264,166],"tags":[402,403,13,22,149],"class_list":["post-3768","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-articles","category-microclub","tag-git","tag-github","tag-initiation","tag-programmation","tag-software"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/3768","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/37"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=3768"}],"version-history":[{"count":3,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/3768\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":3785,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/3768\/revisions\/3785"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/3774"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=3768"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=3768"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=3768"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}